  "title": "一杯咖啡",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 2,
  "rootId": "dialogue.meguru.coffee",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.meguru.coffee",
    "idolId": "meguru",
    "startNodeId": "1-01",
    "nodes": {
      "1-01": {
        "id": "1-01",
        "text": "（好，必要的联络差不多都结束了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "1-02",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-02": {
        "id": "1-02",
        "text": "（已经这个时间了，得早点回去……）",
        "nextNodeId": "1-03",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-03": {
        "id": "1-03",
        "text": "（唉……回去之前先喝一杯咖啡吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "1-04",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-04": {
        "id": "1-04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "制作人，制作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "1-05"
      },
      "1-05": {
        "id": "1-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "早安！",
        "nextNodeId": "1-06"
      },
      "1-06": {
        "id": "1-06",
        "text": "早安……这样啊，我趴在桌上睡着了。",
        "nextNodeId": "1-07",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-07": {
        "id": "1-07",
        "text": "这条毯子是？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-08",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-08": {
        "id": "1-08",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "是叶月放的。她说试着叫过你，但你没醒。",
        "nextNodeId": "1-09"
      },
      "1-09": {
        "id": "1-09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "工作很忙吧……在家里好好睡一觉更好啊——",
        "nextNodeId": "1-10"
      },
      "1-10": {
        "id": "1-10",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "制作人，我最近都没看到你休息啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-11"
      },
      "1-11": {
        "id": "1-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "难道……因为我才这么忙？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-12"
      },
      "1-12": {
        "id": "1-12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "又来看我练习，又来陪我说话……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "不是你的错",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "我很开心，没问题的",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "其实我有休息",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "insight",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "text": "让你这么想，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "制作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "text": "巡每天也都坚持完成严格的课程吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "text": "在舞台上发光是巡的工作，在背后支撑你是我的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-06"
      },
      "2-06": {
        "id": "2-06",
        "text": "不过，我会尽量不让你担心。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-07": {
        "id": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯！要快点好好休息……不是为了我担心，是为了制作人的身体哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-08"
      },
      "2-08": {
        "id": "2-08",
        "text": "嗯。不过巡也没资格说别人吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-09",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-09": {
        "id": "2-09",
        "text": "以后我会给你接更多更多工作的！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-10",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-10": {
        "id": "2-10",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "没关系！我的忙碌就是快乐的意思嘛！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-11"
      },
      "2-11": {
        "id": "2-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "放马过来——！"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "text": "你能这么想我很高兴，不过这样也不行啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "开心是开心……可是那样也不行啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "text": "巡每天也都坚持完成严格的课程吧。在舞台上发光是巡的工作，在背后支撑你是我的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "text": "我会尽量不让你担心。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-06": {
        "id": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯！要快点好好休息……不是为了我担心，是为了制作人的身体哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-07"
      },
      "3-07": {
        "id": "3-07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "那我也要变得让你不用担心的样子！"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "骗人。桌上都是文件。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "text": "……今天确实拖得晚了点。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "text": "巡每天也都坚持完成严格的课程吧。在舞台上发光是巡的工作，在背后支撑你是我的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "text": "我会尽量不让你担心。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-06",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-06": {
        "id": "4-06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯！要快点好好休息……不是为了我担心，是为了制作人的身体哦？"
      }
